OL,3,Vupppppp5CFriday
OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FWe follow the brave A&E
OL,7,     Fnight-shift teams in Belfast,
OL,8,     FNewham and Norwich. At Norfolk and
OL,9,     FNorwich Hospital, a stabbing sends
OL,10,     Fboth victim and attacker to A&E.
OL,11,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,13,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,14,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,15,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic but
OL,16,     Fthat can affect sufferers.
